{"seq":4,"slug":"data-integrity","title":"数据完整性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/database-systems/relational-model/data-integrity","wordCount":836,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"数据完整性\">数据完整性</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>数据完整性（Data Integrity）是指数据库中数据的准确性、一致性和可靠性。关系数据库通过多种约束机制来保障数据完整性，防止无效数据进入系统。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>完整性类型</th>\n<th>保障对象</th>\n<th>机制</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>实体完整性</td>\n<td>主键唯一且非空</td>\n<td>PRIMARY KEY</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>参照完整性</td>\n<td>外键引用有效</td>\n<td>FOREIGN KEY</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>域完整性</td>\n<td>列值在合法范围</td>\n<td>CHECK、NOT NULL、数据类型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>用户定义完整性</td>\n<td>业务规则</td>\n<td>触发器、存储过程</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"实体完整性\">实体完整性</h2><p>实体完整性要求每个表都有主键，且主键值<strong>唯一</strong>且<strong>不为空</strong>。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE employee (&#10;    emp_id    INT PRIMARY KEY,&#10;    name      VARCHAR(50) NOT NULL,&#10;    email     VARCHAR(100) UNIQUE&#10;);&#10;&#10;-- 复合主键&#10;CREATE TABLE order_item (&#10;    order_id   BIGINT,&#10;    product_id BIGINT,&#10;    quantity   INT NOT NULL,&#10;    PRIMARY KEY (order_id, product_id)&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> employee</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    emp_id    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">50</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    email     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UNIQUE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 复合主键</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> order_item</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    order_id   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    product_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    quantity   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (order_id, product_id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>约束</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n<th>允许 NULL</th>\n<th>允许重复</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>PRIMARY KEY</td>\n<td>唯一标识每一行</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>UNIQUE</td>\n<td>确保列值唯一</td>\n<td>是（单个）</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>NOT NULL</td>\n<td>确保列不为空</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"参照完整性\">参照完整性</h2><p>参照完整性通过外键约束确保表之间引用关系的有效性——外键值必须在被引用表的主键中存在，或者为 NULL。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE department (&#10;    dept_id   INT PRIMARY KEY,&#10;    dept_name VARCHAR(50) NOT NULL&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE TABLE employee (&#10;    emp_id  INT PRIMARY KEY,&#10;    name    VARCHAR(50) NOT NULL,&#10;    dept_id INT,&#10;    FOREIGN KEY (dept_id) REFERENCES department(dept_id)&#10;        ON DELETE SET NULL&#10;        ON UPDATE CASCADE&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> department</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    dept_id   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    dept_name </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">50</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> employee</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    emp_id  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">50</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    dept_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    FOREIGN KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (dept_id) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> department(dept_id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        ON DELETE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> SET</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        ON UPDATE CASCADE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"级联操作\">级联操作</h3><p>当被引用表的记录发生变更时，外键约束可以指定不同的级联行为：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>级联策略</th>\n<th>ON DELETE 行为</th>\n<th>ON UPDATE 行为</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>RESTRICT</td>\n<td>拒绝删除（默认）</td>\n<td>拒绝更新（默认）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CASCADE</td>\n<td>同步删除引用行</td>\n<td>同步更新外键值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SET NULL</td>\n<td>将外键设为 NULL</td>\n<td>将外键设为 NULL</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SET DEFAULT</td>\n<td>将外键设为默认值</td>\n<td>将外键设为默认值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>NO ACTION</td>\n<td>延迟检查，事务结束时验证</td>\n<td>延迟检查，事务结束时验证</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 级联删除：删除部门时同步删除所有员工&#10;CREATE TABLE employee_cascade (&#10;    emp_id  INT PRIMARY KEY,&#10;    name    VARCHAR(50),&#10;    dept_id INT,&#10;    FOREIGN KEY (dept_id) REFERENCES department(dept_id)&#10;        ON DELETE CASCADE&#10;        ON UPDATE CASCADE&#10;);&#10;&#10;-- 置空策略：删除部门时员工的 dept_id 设为 NULL&#10;CREATE TABLE employee_setnull (&#10;    emp_id  INT PRIMARY KEY,&#10;    name    VARCHAR(50),&#10;    dept_id INT,&#10;    FOREIGN KEY (dept_id) REFERENCES department(dept_id)&#10;        ON DELETE SET NULL&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 级联删除：删除部门时同步删除所有员工</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> employee_cascade</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    emp_id  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">50</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    dept_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    FOREIGN KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (dept_id) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> department(dept_id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        ON DELETE CASCADE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        ON UPDATE CASCADE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 置空策略：删除部门时员工的 dept_id 设为 NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> employee_setnull</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    emp_id  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">50</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    dept_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    FOREIGN KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (dept_id) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> department(dept_id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        ON DELETE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> SET</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"域完整性\">域完整性</h2><p>域完整性确保列的值满足数据类型和取值范围约束。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE product (&#10;    product_id   SERIAL PRIMARY KEY,&#10;    name         VARCHAR(100) NOT NULL,&#10;    price        DECIMAL(10, 2) CHECK (price &gt; 0),&#10;    stock        INT DEFAULT 0 CHECK (stock &gt;= 0),&#10;    status       VARCHAR(20) CHECK (status IN (&#39;active&#39;, &#39;inactive&#39;, &#39;discontinued&#39;)),&#10;    created_at   TIMESTAMP DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> product</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    product_id   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SERIAL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    price        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DECIMAL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (price </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    stock        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (stock </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'active'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'inactive'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'discontinued'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    created_at   </span><span style=\